        "node_id": "n_3_bc2700",
        "thought_text": "Consider potential edge cases such as $N=1$ (where any $a$ yields the same unusefulness of 0) or large coordinate values that might cause floating-point precision issues. Verify that the derived formula holds for these cases and ensure the output format matches the required precision.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
